IFDEF ERRORS <XLIST>
NOPUNCH
/ NOW FOR ERROR DEFINITIONS. ERRORS OF THE FORM
/ OS8 ERROR AT XXXX.	XXXX DEFINED BELOW
E1	/ INPUT FILE NOT OPEN
E2	/ FAIL TO READ INPUT
E3	/ OUTPUT FILE NOT OPEN
E4	/ OUTPUT FULL
E8	/ FAIL TO WRITE OUTPUT
E10	/ DISK(XX) OR JMS FHANDLE WITH ILLEGAL NO XX
E11	/ FAIL TO CLOSE FILE
E12	/ FAIL TO ENTER FILE
E13	/ FAIL TO ENTER HANDLER. DUE TO EITHER NO SPACE
	/	OR HANDLER NOT AVAILABLE
E14	/ CANNOT CHAIN AS ERROR OCCURED
E15	/ CANNOT CHAIN AS RALGOL OR ABSLDR NOT FOUND
E16	/ FAIL IN ACTUAL CHAIN

/ OR CAN GET HALTS
/ DUE TO BAD READ / WRITE OF BUFFER AREAS AT:
E5	/ WRITE
E6	/ READ
E7	/ READ
E17	/ WRITE

ENPUNCH
